  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/bukkit-plugins/pickaxe-of-the-god-pog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>此模組的插件版本</strong></a></p>\n<p>一把不可破壞的鎬，每破壞一個方塊即可獲得經驗值。</p>\n<p>每個等級所需的經驗值比前一級多 100 點。</p>\n<p>鎬在升級後威力會增強。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">合成：</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1171843/description_b0acb60f-0be5-4a56-a58e-52da89c4c2c2.png\" width=\"362\" height=\"171\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">材質：</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1171843/description_8dae3911-360a-4aef-be73-a7541d3f5583.png\" width=\"495\" height=\"396\"></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
